resources.string:
By enabling it you acknowledge and accept the following risks:

① Platform risk: IM terms of service (e.g. WeChat) forbid automation; accounts may be restricted or banned;
② Mis-send risk: content written by AI goes out directly when unattended. Money, promises, sensitive privacy and ahead-of-stage content are hard-gated and downgraded, but gating is not 100 percent;
③ Scope: whitelisted contacts only (≤5). Each send is delayed randomly by 8–90 seconds; at most %1$d messages per window; during quiet hours only drafts are produced, nothing is sent;
④ Everything runs locally with no cloud involved; the master switch can be turned off anytime and stops all automatic sending.

Use it only in lawful, compliant relationship scenarios where the other party is aware.
